---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Tool Audit — Free Stack Review Call for Law Firm Owners"
  description="Stop buying software to fix a staffing problem. Book a free call and find the jobs in your stack that were never going to be done by software in the first place."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "The Tool Audit",
    "description": "A free staffing call for law firm owners about auditing their software stack for jobs only a person can do.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            You don't have a software problem. <span class="text-gradient-gold">You have an owner problem.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Stop buying software to fix a staffing problem. Book a free call and find the jobs in your stack that were never going to be done by software in the first place.
          </p>

          <!-- Stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="20">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">tools is normal for a small firm &mdash; as few as twelve</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num">1</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">/</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="3">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">of a stack typically has no named owner</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="2">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">hours to audit the whole stack, with your billing statements and a pen</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What the call covers -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Which tools have no named owner</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Four questions every tool has to answer. Most owners can't answer question two for a third of their stack.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.306a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.518l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The five jobs software will never fix</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Answering live after hours, calling back inside 15 minutes, following up until there's a decision &mdash; only a person does these.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">What the Kill column savings should actually buy</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Not another tool. Part of a trained person who does the jobs inside the tools you kept.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; 30 minutes
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No product sold or named
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Built inside a working law firm
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Staffing Call</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/magnet-the-tool-audit-playbook?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OPENING — the story + five jobs software will never fix
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">Read This First</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            Count the subscriptions. Then count the problems that went away.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Case management, phones, texting, e-signature, intake forms, a CRM, a chat widget, scheduling, document automation, accounting, a dialer, two things you forgot you had. Twelve to twenty tools is normal for a small firm. Every one of them was bought to solve a problem.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Now count the problems that went away. Calls still go to voicemail at 6 PM. Leads still get one follow-up and then silence. Records still sit for 60 days. The tools didn't fail. Each one added a job, and nobody at the firm owns the job.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            Software doesn't call a client back. A person does, using the software.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: five jobs only a person does -->
        <div class="reveal space-y-4" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-1">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Answering the phone live, after hours</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">About a third of calls go unanswered during posted business hours, before a single night or weekend. A voicemail tool takes a message. Taking a message is not intake.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-2">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Calling back inside 15 minutes</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Contact odds drop about 100 times between a 5-minute and a 30-minute response. The lead form can alert you in seconds. Someone still has to pick up the phone.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-3">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Following up until there's a decision</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Signing takes roughly 10 to 15 touches. An automated drip sends emails. It doesn't have a conversation on call number nine, which is the one that signs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card" style="animation: lpSlideIn 0.5s ease 0.55s both;">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Telling a client what is happening in their case</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">A status template with no new information teaches the client your emails say nothing. "The demand went out Tuesday" is a person's job.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner mt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;Every tool on your Kill list was bought to avoid hiring for one of these five.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       FOUR QUESTIONS EVERY TOOL HAS TO ANSWER
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">The Test</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Four questions every tool has to answer.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Write the four answers for every tool in your stack. Most owners can't answer question two for a third of it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 reveal mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">What job does it do?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">One sentence. If the answer is a list of features, you don't know what it's for.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Who runs it?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">A name. Not "the team." If there's no name, the tool is running itself, which means it isn't running.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">What happens if it's off for a week?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">If the honest answer is "nothing," that's your answer about whether to keep paying for it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">4</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Does it talk to the case management system?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Every tool that holds client or case data and doesn't sync is a second copy of the truth. Second copies drift.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-rule-box max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="lp-rule-box-label">Is This A Tool Problem Or A Person Problem?</span>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-navy font-heading">If the job needs judgment, a conversation, or persistence, software can track it and a person has to do it. If the job is the same every time and needs no judgment, automate it and stop paying someone to do it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;Firms get this backwards in both directions. They buy a chat widget to replace an intake person, and they pay a paralegal to hand-type deadline reminders.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       KEEP / KILL / CONNECT
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">The Sort</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5">
          Three columns. <span class="text-gradient-gold">Every tool lands in one.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Most firms find three to five tools in Kill on the first pass.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto reveal mb-14">
        <div class="lp-fix-card-v2 lp-fix-card-v2--blue">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Keep</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">One clear job, a named owner, it syncs to the case system, and turning it off would break something.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-fix-card-v2">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-red-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Kill</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">No owner, no job you can state in a sentence, a duplicate of something in Keep, or nothing breaks when it's off. Cancel it this month.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-fix-card-v2 lp-fix-card-v2--purple">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Connect</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">The job is real and the owner is real, but it holds data that doesn't sync. Turn on the integration, replace it, or assign a weekly reconcile task.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 reveal mb-6">
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">97%</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Answer rate 24/7, up from 82%</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">15 min</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Max speed to lead, down from 34</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">6</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Follow-up touches in 3 days</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">109</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Cases signed by one staff member in 30 days</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 mb-10 reveal">Attorney Assistant client figures, real client files, identities protected.</p>

      <div class="text-center reveal">
        <a href="#book-now" class="btn-primary btn-lg group inline-flex">
          Sort Your Stack
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       FEWER TOOLS. MORE OWNERS.
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
